hadiths[45]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1556","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Ibrahim bin Muhammad ne hamein khabar di, Abdul Aziz bin Ubaidillah bin Abdullah bin Amr se, Muhammad bin Abi Bakr bin Amr bin Hazm se, Amrah bint Abdur Rahman se, Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mu'azzaz logon ki laghzishon se darguzar karo."
"1557","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Idris ne farmaya: Main ne ahl ilm mein se un se suna jo is hadees ko jante hain, kehte hain: Mu'azzaz aadmi ki laghzish se darguzar kiya jata hai jab tak woh hadd na ho."
"1558","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Amr bin Dinar se, Abu Ja'far se: Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Agar Qudamah ko aaj kode lagaye jayen to us ke baad koi nahin chhoda jayega, aur Qudamah Badri the. Dono hadeesein Kitab Janaiz se, aur teesri Kitab Ashribah se nikali."
"1559","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan bin Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Zuhri se, Abu Idris se, Ubadah bin Samit se, unhon ne farmaya: Hum Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath ek majlis mein the. To Aap ne farmaya: Mujh se bai'at karo is par ke tum Allah ke sath kisi cheez ko shareek na karoge. Aur Aap ne un par ayat padhi, aur farmaya: Jo tum mein se wafa kare to us ka ajr Allah par hai, aur jo is mein se koi cheez kare aur use us par saza di jaye to woh us ke liye kaffara hai, aur jo is mein se koi cheez kare aur Allah use us par chhupa le, to woh Allah ki taraf hai, agar chahe use bakhsh de aur agar chahe use azab de. Kitab Janaiz se nikali."
"1560","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein hadees bayan ki, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Zuhri se, Qabeesah bin Zuaib se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar woh piye to use kode lagao, phir agar woh piye to use kode lagao, phir agar woh piye to use kode lagao, phir agar woh piye to use qatl kar do. Zuhri nahin jante teesri ke baad ya chauthi ke. Phir ek aadmi laya gaya jis ne pi thi to unhon ne use kode lagaye. Phir woh laya gaya aur us ne pi thi to unhon ne use kode lagaye. Phir woh laya gaya aur us ne pi thi to unhon ne use kode lagaye; aur qatl ko chhod diya aur woh rukhsat ban gayi. Sufyan ne farmaya: Zuhri ne Mansoor bin Mu'tamir aur Mukhawwal se farmaya: Is hadees ke sath Iraq ke wafd bano."
"1561","[AI-translation] Sufyan bin Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Zuhri se, Qabeesah bin Zuaib se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar woh sharab piye to use kode lagao. Pehli Kitab Ashribah se aur doosri Kitab Ikhtilaful Hadees se nikali."
"1562","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein hadees bayan ki, Ma'mar se, Zuhri se, Abdur Rahman bin Azhar se, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Hunain ke saal Khalid bin Walid ke kooch ke bare mein poochte dekha. To main Aap ke aage dauda Khalid ke kooch ke bare mein poochta raha yahan tak ke woh un ke paas zakhmi haalat mein aaye. Aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas ek sharabi laya gaya, to Aap ne farmaya: Use maro. To unhon ne use haathon aur jootiyon aur kapdon ke kinaron se mara aur us par mitti daali. Phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use malamat karo. To unhon ne use malamat kiya. Phir use chhod diya. Unhon ne farmaya: Phir jab Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) the, to unhon ne us mare gaye ko hazir hone walon se poocha. To use chalis qarar diya. To Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ne sharab mein chalis lagaye apni zindagi bhar, phir Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne chalis, yahan tak ke log sharab peene mein badhte gaye. To unhon ne mashwara kiya aur use assi lagaye."
"1563","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Saur bin Zaid Daili se: Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne sharab ke bare mein mashwara kiya jise aadmi peeta hai, to Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Hum is mein samajhte hain ke use assi lagaye jayen; kyunke jab woh peeta hai to nashay mein hota hai, aur jab nashay mein hota hai to bakta hai, aur jab bakta hai to jhoot bandhta hai, ya jaisa unhon ne farmaya: To Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne use sharab mein assi lagaye. Dono hadeesein Kitab Ashribah se nikali."
"1564","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein hadees bayan ki, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan bin Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Amr bin Dinar se, Abu Ja'far Muhammad bin Ali se: Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Waleed ko do sire wale kode se mara. Kitab Ashribah se nikali."
"1565","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein hadees bayan ki, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Sa'ib bin Yazid se: Unhon ne use khabar di: Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) un ke paas nikle aur farmaya: Main ne fulan ke paas sharab ki boo payi. Us ne kaha ke us ne tila piya hai, aur main us ke piye ke bare mein poochunga, agar woh nashawar hui to main use kode lagaunga. Phir Umar ne use poori hadd lagayi."
"1566","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Zuhri se, Sa'ib bin Yazid se: Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) nikle aur janaze par namaz padhayi. To Sa'ib ne unhein kehte suna: Main ne Ubaidullah aur us ke sathiyon ke paas sharab ki boo payi hai. Aur main un ke piye ke bare mein poochunga, agar woh nashawar hui to main un par hadd lagaoonga. Unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne farmaya: Mujhe Ma'mar ne Zuhri se, Sa'ib bin Yazid se khabar di: Woh un par hadd lagane mein hazir the."
"1567","[AI-translation] Muslim bin Khalid Zanji ne hamein khabar di, Yahya bin Juraij se, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Ata se kaha: Kya sharab ki boo mein kode lagaye jayenge? To Ata ne farmaya: Boo us sharab se hoti hai jis mein kharabi hai, phir jab woh sab ek sharab par jama hon aur un mein se ek nashay mein ho jaye to un sab ko poori hadd lagayi jayegi. Shafi'i ne farmaya: Ata ka qaul Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhuma) ke qaul ki tarah hai, us ki mukhalifat nahin karta."
"1568","[AI-translation] Ibrahim bin Abi Yahya ne hamein khabar di, Ja'far bin Muhammad se, apne walid se: Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Mere paas koi nahin laya jayega jis ne sharab ya nashawar nabeedh pi ho magar main use hadd lagaunga. Yeh chaaron hadeesein Kitab Ashribah se nikali."
"1569","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Abdul Wahhab ne hamein khabar di, Yunus se, Hasan se, Ubadah yani Ibn Samit (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujh se lo, mujh se lo. Allah ne un ke liye rasta bana diya hai, kunwari kunware ke sath sau kode aur ek saal ki jilawatni, aur shaadishuda shaadishuda ke sath sau kode aur rajm."
"1570","[AI-translation] Aur mujhe siqah ne hadees bayan ki: Hasan un ke aur Ubadah ke darmiyan Hittan Raqashi dakhil karte the, aur main nahin janta kya Abdul Wahhab ne use un dono ke darmiyan dakhil kiya aur woh meri kitab se gir gaya jab main ne use muntaqil kiya jabke woh asl mein hai ya nahin? Aur asl jis din main ne yeh kitab likhi mujh se ghaib hai."
"1571","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se ke unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna: Rajm Allah ki kitab mein haq hai us par jo zina kare jab woh mardon aur aurton mein se muhsan ho, jab us par daleel qayam ho jaye ya hamal ya iqrar ho."
"1572","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Yahya bin Sa'id se, ke unhon ne Sa'id bin Musayyab ko kehte suna: Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Khabardar raho ke tum rajm ki ayat se halaak ho jao, koi kehne wala kahe: Hum Allah Ta'ala ki kitab mein do hadan nahin pate. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne rajm kiya aur hum ne rajm kiya, Qasam us Zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Agar log na kehte: Umar ne Allah ki kitab mein izafa kiya, to main use likhta: Budha aur budhiya, un dono ko zaroor rajm karo. Hum ne use padha tha."
"1573","[AI-translation] Malik aur Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah se, Abu Hurairah aur Zaid bin Khalid se, aur Sufyan aur Shibl ne izafa kiya, ke ek aadmi ne zikr kiya ke us ke bete ne ek aadmi ki biwi se zina kiya. To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main tum dono ke darmiyan Allah ki kitab se faisla karunga. Phir unhon ne us ke bete ko sau kode lagaye, aur use ek saal jilawatan kiya, aur Unais ko hukm diya ke woh doosre ki biwi ke paas subah jaye, agar woh iqrar kare to use rajm kare. Phir us ne iqrar kiya to use rajm kiya."
"1574","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Zuhri se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Utbah se, Abu Hurairah se. Aur Zaid bin Khalid Juhani se: Un dono ne use khabar di: Do aadmi Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas jhagde. To un mein se ek ne kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasool, hamare darmiyan Allah ki kitab se faisla farmayen. Aur doosre ne aur woh un dono mein zyada samajhdar tha: Han aye Allah ke Rasool, hamare darmiyan Allah ki kitab se faisla farmayen, aur mujhe ijazat den ke main bolun. Aap ne farmaya: Bolo. Unhon ne kaha: Mera beta is ke paas mazdoor tha. Phir us ne us ki biwi se zina kiya. To mujhe khabar di gayi ke mere bete par rajm hai. To main ne us se sau bakriyan aur apni laundi fidye mein di. Phir main ne ahl ilm se poocha, to unhon ne mujhe khabar di ke mere bete par sau kode aur ek saal ki jilawatni hai; rajm sirf us ki biwi par hai. To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qasam us Zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Main tum dono ke darmiyan Allah Ta'ala ki kitab se faisla karunga: Rahi tumhari bakriyan aur tumhari laundi, to tumhari taraf wapas. Aur unhon ne us ke bete ko sau kode lagaye aur use ek saal jilawatan kiya, aur Unais Aslami ko hukm diya ke woh doosre ki biwi ke paas jaye, agar woh iqrar kare to use rajm kare. Phir us ne iqrar kiya to use rajm kiya."
"1575","[AI-translation] Malik bin Anas ne hamein khabar di, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne zina karne wale do Yahudiyon ko rajm kiya."
"1576","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Yahya bin Sa'id aur Abu Zinad se, dono se, Abu Umamah bin Sahl bin Hunaif se: Ek aadmi ne, un mein se ek ne kaha: Bade pet wala, aur doosre ne kaha: Apahij, Sa'd ke pados mein tha. Phir us ne ek aurat se zina kiya aur hamal ho gaya. To use us ke sath mansoob kiya gaya. To us se poocha gaya aur us ne iqrar kiya. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us ke bare mein hukm farmaya. Un mein se ek ne kaha: Use khajoor ke khoshe se mara gaya; aur doosre ne kaha: Khajoor ke uskhool se."
"1577","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se ke unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna: Rajm Allah Ta'ala ki kitab mein haq hai us par jo zina kare jab woh mardon ya aurton mein se muhsan ho, jab us par daleel qayam ho jaye ya hamal ya iqrar ho."
"1578","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Yahya bin Sa'id se, Sulaiman bin Yasar se, Abu Waqid Laisi se: Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas ek aadmi aaya jab woh Shaam mein the. To us ne unhein zikr kiya ke us ne apni biwi ke sath ek aadmi paya. To Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Abu Waqid Laisi ko us ki biwi ki taraf bheja take us se is bare mein pooche. To woh us ke paas aaye aur us ke paas aurten us ke ird-gird thin. To unhon ne use woh zikr kiya jo us ke shohar ne Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) se kaha tha, aur use khabar di ke woh us ke qaul se nahin pakdi jayegi, aur use usi jaisi talqeen karte rahe take woh inkar kare. To us ne inkar se inkar kiya, aur iqrar par qayam rahi. To Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne us ke bare mein hukm farmaya aur use rajm kiya gaya."
"1579","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe Ubaidullah bin Abi Yazid ne apne walid se hadees bayan ki: Ek aadmi ne ek aurat se nikah kiya jis ki beti us ke siva se thi, aur us ka beta us ke siva se tha. To ladke ne ladki se zina kiya aur us mein hamal zahir ho gaya. Jab Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) Makkah tashreef laye, to yeh un ke paas uthaya gaya. To unhon ne un dono se poocha aur un dono ne iqrar kiya. To Umar ne un dono ko hadd lagayi, aur un dono ko jama karne ki hirs ki. To ladke ne inkar kiya. Yeh paanch hadeesein Kitab Ikhtilaful Hadees se, chhathi aur saatwin Kitab Risalah se, aathwin Kitab Yameen ma' Shahid se, nawin Kitab Janaiz se, daswin aur gyarahwin Kitab Qat' fis Sariqah se, aur barahwin Kitab Ishratin Nisa se nikali."
"1580","[AI-translation] Shafi'i ne apni kitab mein farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Ayyub bin Abi Musa se, Sa'id bin Abi Sa'id se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ki laundi zina kare aur us ka zina zahir ho jaye to use hadd lagao, aur use malamat na karo, phir agar woh laut kar zina kare aur us ka zina zahir ho jaye to use hadd lagao aur use malamat na karo, phir agar woh laut kar zina kare aur us ka zina zahir ho jaye to use bech do chahe baal ki rassi ke badle, yani rassi. Kitab Janaiz se."
"1581","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Amr bin Dinar se, Hasan bin Muhammad bin Ali se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki beti Fatimah ne apni us laundi par hadd lagayi jis ne zina kiya tha. Pehli Kitab Ikhtilaf Ali wa Abdillah mein se, us mein se jo Rabi' ne Shafi'i se nahin suna, aur doosri Kitab Janaiz se nikali."
"1582","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Muslim bin Khalid ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Hisham bin Urwah se, apne walid se: Yahya bin Hatib ne unhein hadees bayan ki, unhon ne farmaya: Hatib fout hue aur unhon ne apne ghulamon mein se use aazad kiya jis ne namaz padhi aur roza rakha. Aur un ki ek Habshi laundi thi jis ne namaz padhi aur roza rakha tha, aur woh ajami thi, phir use us ke hamal ke siva koi cheez na ghabra saka; aur woh thayyib thi. To woh Umar ke paas gaye aur unhein bataya. To Umar ne farmaya: Tum woh aadmi ho jo khair nahin lata. Aur is ne unhein ghabraya. To Umar ne us ki taraf bheja, aur farmaya: Kya tum hamila ho? To us ne kaha: Han, Mar'oosh se do dirham mein. Phir woh ise khul kar keh rahi thi, use nahin chhupati thi. Unhon ne farmaya: Unhein Ali, Usman, aur Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhum) mile. To unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe mashwara do. To Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) baithe the aur let gaye. To Ali aur Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne farmaya: Us par hadd waqe ho gayi hai. To unhon ne farmaya: Aye Usman, mujhe mashwara do. To unhon ne farmaya: Tumhare dono bhaiyon ne tumhein mashwara de diya hai. To unhon ne farmaya: Tum mujhe mashwara do. To unhon ne farmaya: Main use dekhta hun ise khul kar kehti hai goya woh ise nahin janti; hadd sirf us par hai jo ise janta ho. To unhon ne farmaya: Tum ne sach kaha; Qasam us Zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, hadd sirf us par hai jo ise janta ho. To Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne use sau lagaye aur ek saal jilawatan kiya. Kitab Ikhtilaful Hadees se nikali."
"1583","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Amrah se, Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hath chauthayi deenar ya us se upar mein kata jayega."
"1584","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek chor ka hath ek dhal ke badle kata jis ki qeemat teen dirham thi."
"1585","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Abdullah bin Abi Bakr bin Hazm se, apne walid se, Amrah bint Abdur Rahman se: Ek chor ne Usman ke daur mein utrujjah churaya. To Usman ne us ka hukm diya aur us ki qeemat teen dirham lagayi gayi, barah ke badle ek deenar ke hisab se. To unhon ne us ka hath kata."
"1586","[AI-translation] Malik ne farmaya: Aur woh utrujjah hai jise log khate hain. Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Humaid Taweel se: Unhon ne Qatadah ko Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se qat' ke bare mein poochte suna. To Anas ne farmaya: Main Abu Bakr Siddiq (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas hazir tha, unhon ne ek chor ka hath aisi cheez mein kata jo mujhe pasand nahin ke woh mere liye teen dirham ke badle ho."
"1587","[AI-translation] Hamein ek se zyada ne khabar di, Ja'far bin Muhammad se, apne walid se, Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne farmaya: Hath chauthayi deenar ya us se upar mein kata jayega."
"1588","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Abdullah bin Abi Bakr se, Amrah bint Abdur Rahman se: Unhon ne farmaya: Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) Makkah ki taraf niklin, Allah use sharaf de, aur un ke sath do laundiyan aur Abdullah bin Abi Bakr ke bete ka ghulam tha. To unhon ne do laundiyon ke sath ek dhari-dar chadar bheji jis par sabz kapda sila hua tha. Unhon ne farmaya: Ghulam ne chadar li aur us ki silai kholi, use nikala, aur us ki jagah libd ya farw rakh diya, aur us par silai kar di. Jab dono laundiyan Madinah pahunchin, unhon ne use us ke ghar walon ko de diya. Jab unhon ne us ki silai kholi, to unhon ne us mein libd paya aur us mein chadar na payi. To unhon ne dono laundiyon se baat ki, to un dono ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja Aishah se baat ki. To unhon ne us ka hath kata. Aur Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne farmaya: Hath chauthayi deenar ya us se upar mein kata jayega."
"1589","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Abdur Rahman bin Qasim se, apne walid se: Yaman walon mein se ek aadmi kata hua hath paon, Abu Bakr Siddiq (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aaya. To us ne un se shikayat ki ke Yaman ke aamil ne us par zulm kiya. Woh raat ko namaz padhta tha. To Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Tumhare baap ki qasam, tumhari raat chor ki raat nahin. Phir unhon ne Asma bint Umais, Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ki biwi ke zewar gum paye. To woh aadmi un ke sath ghoomne laga aur kehta: Aye Allah, Tujh par hai jo is nek ghar walon par raat ko aaya. To unhon ne zewar sunar ke paas paya; kata hua use laya tha. To kate hue ne iqrar kiya ya us par gawahi di gayi. To Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hukm farmaya aur us ka bayan hath kata gaya. Aur Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Us ki apne upar baddua mujhe us ki chori se zyada sakht lagi. Yeh chhe hadeesein Kitab Qat' fis Sariqah se nikali."
"1590","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Safwan bin Abdullah bin Safwan se: Safwan bin Umayyah se kaha gaya: Jo hijrat na kare halaak ho gaya. To Safwan Madinah aaye aur masjid mein apni chadar takiya bana kar soye. Phir ek chor aaya aur us ki chadar us ke sir ke neeche se li. To Safwan ne chor pakad liya aur use Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas laye. To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us ka hukm farmaya aur us ka hath kata gaya. To unhon ne farmaya: Main ne yeh nahin chaha tha; woh us par sadqa hai. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum use mere paas lane se pehle kyun na aise karte."
"1591","[AI-translation] Sufyan bin Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Amr bin Shuaib se, Tawus se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se Malik ki hadees ki tarah. Dono hadeesein Kitab Qat' was Sariqah se nikali."
"1592","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Hisham bin Urwah se, apne walid se, Yahya bin Abdur Rahman bin Hatib se: Hatib ke ghulamon ne Muzainah wale ek aadmi ki oontni churayi aur use zibah kiya. To yeh Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas uthaya gaya. To unhon ne Kaseer bin Salt ko un ke hath katne ka hukm farmaya. Phir Umar ne farmaya: Main tumhein dekhta hun unhein bhooka rakhte ho. Allah ki qasam! Main tum par aisa jurmana lagaunga jo tum par shaq guzrega. Phir unhon ne Muzani se farmaya: Tumhari oontni ki qeemat kitni hai? Unhon ne farmaya: Chaar sau dirham. Umar ne farmaya: Use aath sau dirham do."
"1593","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se: Un ka ek ghulam bhag kar chori karta tha. To Sa'id bin Aas ne us ka hath katne se inkar kiya. To Ibn Umar ne us ka hukm farmaya aur us ka hath kata gaya. Dono hadeesein Kitab Ikhtilaf Malik wash Shafi'i mein nikali."
"1594","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Sa'ib bin Yazid se: Ubaidullah bin Amr Hadhrami apna ek ghulam Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas laya. To us ne un se kaha: Is ka hath kato; us ne chori ki hai. To Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Us ne kis mein chori ki? Unhon ne farmaya: Us ne meri biwi ka aaina churaya jis ki qeemat sath dirham hai. To Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne un se farmaya: Use chhod do; us par qat' nahin. Tumhara khadim ne tumhara saman churaya hai."
"1595","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Abi Husain se, Amr bin Shuaib se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ke Aap ne farmaya: Latke hue phal mein qat' nahin. Phir jab use khalihan jama kar le to us mein qat' hai."
"1596","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Yahya bin Sa'id se, Muhammad bin Yahya bin Hibban se, apne chacha Wasi' bin Hibban se: Rafi' bin Khadij ne unhein khabar di: Unhon ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Phal aur khajoor ke gude mein qat' nahin."
"1597","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Yahya bin Sa'id se, Muhammad bin Yahya bin Hibban se, apne chacha Wasi' bin Hibban se, Rafi' bin Khadij se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se usi ki tarah. Yeh teenon hadeesein Kitab Qat' fis Sariqah se nikali."
"1598","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Ibrahim bin Abi Yahya ne hamein khabar di, Ja'far se, apne walid se, Ali bin Husain se, unhon ne farmaya: Nahin, Allah ki qasam, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne aankh nahin phodi aur doodh wali oontniyon walon par un ke hath paon katne ke siva izafa nahin kiya."
"1599","[AI-translation] Ibrahim ne hamein khabar di, Salih maula Tauamah se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se, raste ke dakuon ke bare mein: Jab woh qatl karen aur maal len to unhein qatl kiya jayega aur sooli di jayegi. Aur jab woh qatl karen aur maal na len to unhein qatl kiya jayega aur sooli nahin di jayegi. Aur jab woh maal len aur qatl na karen to un ke hath aur paon mukhalif taraf se kate jayenge. Aur jab woh rasta khaufzada karen aur maal na len to unhein zameen se jilawatan kiya jayega."
"1600","[AI-translation] Aur Amr bin Dinar se, unhon ne farmaya: Har cheez Quran mein hai ya us ke liye jaise woh chahe. Ibn Juraij ne farmaya: Siwae Allah Ta'ala ke farman ke: Jo Allah aur us ke Rasool se ladte hain un ki jaza yahi hai (Al-Ma'idah: 33). To us mein ikhtiyar nahin. Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Jaisa Ibn Juraij aur ghair ne farmaya: Jo Allah aur us ke Rasool se ladte hain un ki jaza yahi hai (Al-Ma'idah: 33). Is masle mein muharib ke bare mein main kehta hun. Pehli Kitab Qitalul Mushrikeen se, doosri Kitab Qat' fis Sariqah se, aur teesri Kitab Manasik se nikali."
